    <summary type="text">after desktop-crash-2026 I need to set new things up, I&#39;ll track work here</summary>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Overview&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#overview&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;after &lt;a href=&#34;/desktop-crash-2026/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;Desktop Crash 2026&#34; data-description=&#34;Desktop crashed days ago, apparently my primary drive has been going bad for a while and eventually it just died.&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-04-22&#34; data-preview=&#34;Desktop crashed days ago, apparently my primary drive has been going bad for a while and eventually it just died.&#34;&gt;Desktop Crash 2026&lt;/a&gt; I need to set new things up, I&amp;rsquo;ll track work here&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;services&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Services&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#services&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; NEED TO SETUP &lt;a href=&#34;/docker/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;docker - container runtime&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;docker&#34;&gt;DOCKER&lt;/a&gt; WAIT FOR ZFS&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; speakr&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;took it, and all the &amp;ldquo;ai&amp;rdquo; stack off &amp;lsquo;phantomlink&amp;rsquo;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;it came back with all my data after shifting it around disks&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; need to reverify this after zfs dataset move&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; ollama&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;lazydocker + &lt;code&gt;E&lt;/code&gt; to pop a shell&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; validate model migration from boot disk volumes path to zfs&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; whisper_asr&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;up just fine, speakr using it for transcription&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; open-webui&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;corrupted database, not sure what to do&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;new instance&amp;hellip; just lose what I had&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; dad-can-i-wear-this model&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; remove /var/docker-storage-zfs/volumes/ after ollama migration&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;ssh&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;SSH&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#ssh&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Need to update my new ssh config and handles keys. I&amp;rsquo;ll use this as an&#xA;opportunity to not proliferate tons of keys on my machine. I was making new&#xA;keys per user per client machine per target machine&amp;hellip; I think I&amp;rsquo;ll just go&#xA;back to ssh&amp;rsquo;ing as myself and only generate keys per client. ie. from my&#xA;desktop I&amp;rsquo;ll only need 1 key except in the case of some of my boxes where I&#xA;setup a different user, so maybe I&amp;rsquo;ll be cleaning up the users on some things&#xA;as well&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;/forgejo/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;self-hosted code forge - codeberg - fork of gittea&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;forgejo&#34;&gt;forgejo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; pihole (I dont think this is around anymore, it&amp;rsquo;s the .3 in my old ssh config)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; pihole-vpn (is this still around?)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; opnsense&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;update admin from dumbledore to nic?&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; ghost&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; ghost-vault&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; router (same config as opnsense, probably dont&amp;rsquo; need both)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; pi3 (this is the real pihole I think)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; rootpi3 (config for root user&amp;hellip; why not just sudo su when I login?)&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; miix&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;&lt;input checked=&#34;&#34; disabled=&#34;&#34; type=&#34;checkbox&#34;&gt; jetkvm&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;data&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Data&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#data&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;see &lt;a href=&#34;/dataops/&#34; class=&#34;wikilink&#34; data-title=&#34;DataOps&#34; data-description=&#34;old: using-restic-to-backup-my-home-directory&#34; data-date=&#34;2026-05-07&#34; data-preview=&#34;old: using-restic-to-backup-my-home-directory&#34;&gt;DataOps&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;plans-to-build&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;heading-wear-glyph&#34;&gt;Plans to build&lt;/span&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;#plans-to-build&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;vibe code an observability thing that&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;runs a restore in a container&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;run some &lt;a href=&#34;/kind/&#34; class=&#34;glossary-term&#34; title=&#34;kind - kubernetes in docker&#34; data-hover-title=&#34;kind&#34;&gt;kind&lt;/a&gt; of setup in that container at least for my shell and neovim and things&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;networking for babyblue-aurora -&amp;gt; aurora transition&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;lament draft posts that are lost&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;ssh keys&amp;hellip; lost .skm directory, look if it&amp;rsquo;s copied anywhere otherwise rotate keys and simplify&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;workspace backup everynight&amp;hellip; abuse git for this&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;or rsync to external drive, you have zfs on aurora now&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;opencode to address neovim logs&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;switch to zellij?&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;what would have to translate from tmux? probably quite a few keybindings&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;</content>
